003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e有缘人，可对我古华派的重地有兴趣…啊呀！是少侠/女侠！\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"nqb471m7nmnT1710863941173\":{\"option\":\"【遇见有缘人了吗？】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e托少侠/女侠带来的运势，近来有不少游客随我参观了王山厅，还都很有诚意…\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e虽说他们也没留下太多摩拉，但多少充实了修缮王山厅的资金。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e少侠/女侠若是有兴趣，可以再来王山厅转转！\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"z2tn3pzsbujT1710863943430\":{\"option\":\"【还需要我给你做顿饭吗？】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e不劳少侠/女侠了！心意早就到了！\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e相反，若是有机会，还得由我为少侠/女侠做份好菜，或是直接下馆子。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e呃，慢着，我算算这几天的开销…\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e咳咳！改日一定请少侠/女侠大快朵颐一顿！\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"}},\"root_id\":\"8gfxrw8wla9T1710863939170\",\"child_ids\":{\"4cf2vhylew3T1710863944349\":[],\"8gfxrw8wla9T1710863939170\":[\"nqb471m7nmnT1710863941173\",\"z2tn3pzsbujT1710863943430\",\"4cf2vhylew3T1710863944349\"],\"nqb471m7nmnT1710863941173\":[],\"z2tn3pzsbujT1710863943430\":[]}}\n","style":""}],"id":"3885","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false}],"filter_values":{},"menu_id":"0","menu_name":"","version":"1716775670","langs":[],"template_layout":{"tab":[{"tab_id":"69","tab_name":"页签1","module_group":[{"module_group_id":"691","layout":"l2r1","module":[{"id":"1207","pos":"left"},{"id":"1208","pos":"right"},{"id":"3882","pos":"banner"}],"name":"基本资料","repeated":false,"parent_group_id":"0"},{"module_group_id":"692","layout":"l1r1","module":[{"id":"1209","pos":"banner"}],"name":"","repeated":true,"parent_group_id":"0"},{"module_group_id":"693","layout":"l1r1","module":[{"id":"12